<title>USA: Di Industries closes $175mln sr note offer.</title>
<headline>Di Industries closes $175mln sr note offer.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>DI Industries Inc said Friday it closed a $175 million senior note offering.</p>
<p>The notes, unsecured senior obligations with a 8.875 percent interest rate due July 1 2007, were issued at a discount resulting in gross proceeds of about $174.1 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Moody's Investor Service rated the notes B1 and Standard &amp; Poor's B+, DI said, adding Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette, BT Securities and ING Barings underwrote the issue.</p>
</text>
